    ex:sourceSummary "Beast of Two Worlds (Ajakaju) is a 2024 Nigerian thriller film produced by Eniola Ajao and directed by Adebayo Tijani and Odunlade Adekola. The film stars Eniola Ajao, Odunlade Adekola, Sola Sobowale, Femi Adebayo, Lateef Adedimeji, Fathia Balogun, Bimbo Akintola, Olayode Juliana and others. The film which is Ajao's debut cinema production, was produced in collaboration with Anthill Studios, owned by Niyi Akinmolayan. Beast of Two Worlds (Ajakaju) was released in Nigerian cinemas on Friday, 29 March 2024." ;
